Open Claude Code with a model

Usage: wally claude-code [OPTIONS] [args...]

Arguments:
  args                        Passed through to the tool

Options:
  -h, --help                  Show help
  -m, --model TEXT            A model on this machine, or a hosted one from your account
      --serve                 Print the endpoint and keep it open instead of launching

Examples:
  wally claude-code -m qwen3-0.6b               A model on this machine
  wally claude-code -m glm-5.3-flash            A hosted model (needs `wally account login`)
